ation command exits 0 before that leaf closes.\n\n## Child decomposition\nEach directory/subsystem cohort owns all criteria for its exact path set. Cohort path sets are disjoint; their union is this workstream scope.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"This workstream container makes no repository edits directly. Its leaf group tickets hold the exact paths; their commits and completion comments are the implementation evidence.","parent_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6","ticket_type":"story","title":"Condense production-source comments","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1a05be62-fde1-4ddd-86eb-2fa2ea13431a","2dac1fc7-eef2-47fd-a409-db778c564923","fabb32f3-2815-427c-9f7d-c26eb1b8123e","dd8d2a68-beea-4f8d-9036-dc8a1eb3584b"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788586172647018002,"uuid":"1f0fc7b4-ab5c-49b8-b288-28c998a9aa39"}